<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Eating is man’s destiny</l><l>And the Lord’s recovery;</l><l>This defeats the enemy—</l><l>Overcome!</l><l>Come enjoy the tree of life,</l><l>Leave the doctrines, leave the strife!</l><l>Overcome by eating Christ—</l><l>Overcome!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Teachings ne’er transform the soul,</l><l>Teachings never reach God’s goal,</l><l>Eating Christ will do it all—</l><l>Overcome!</l><l>We must overcome to eat,</l><l>By ourselves and when we meet,</l><l>Eat Him as the feast complete—</l><l>Overcome!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Eating gives the manchild birth,</l><l>Eating brings the Lord to earth;</l><l>Eat Him now midst all the dearth—</l><l>Overcome!</l><l>Be the manchild Christ requires,</l><l>Thus the church that He desires,</l><l>Then the Bride that He admires—</l><l>Overcome!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
